<p dir="auto">This more or less supersedes <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3586308211" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/28375" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28375/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/28375">#28375</a>, which was under some debate concerning this bug, and which is not as important if the bug is fixed.</p>]]></content>
